// VeltOS (veltos-store): package installations never stop to ask.
// A changed configuration file keeps the version on the PC (dpkg's
// question about it waited for an answer nobody could give from VeltOS
// Store, Graphics Cards or the first start's update), and apt waits for
// another installation to finish instead of failing at once.
DPkg::Options { "--force-confdef"; "--force-confold"; };
DPkg::Lock::Timeout "600";
